# The build context is the repo root (the Go module spans services/), so keep
# everything the image does not need out of it: a fat context is slow to send
# to the daemon and busts the layer cache on unrelated edits.
.git
bin/
docs/
CLAUDE.md
platform/local/volumes/
platform/terraform/
observability/
gitops/
models/
policy/
**/__pycache__/
*.md
